Q2. What are the roles of Subject
and Observer?

Interview Ready Answer

Subject (Publisher)

Responsibilities

• Maintains a list of observers.
• Allows observers to Subscribe.
• Allows observers to Unsubscribe.
• Notifies all observers when
  its state changes.

------------------------------------------------------------

Observer (Subscriber)

Responsibilities

• Registers with the Subject.
• Receives notifications.
• Updates itself whenever
  the Subject changes.

------------------------------------------------------------

